\title{People and agents}

\p{Every tree names its writer with \code{\verb~|\author~} and the people who directed or revised it with \code{\verb~|\contributor~}. Both point at one of the identity trees below, so the page of an identity lists everything it wrote. An agent identity is one model version; add a new identity tree when a new model starts writing here.}

